      "releaseNotes": "Improvements:\n- Updated to align with the latest missions.\n- Fixed the visibility of the status bar on certain pages.\n\nAdded missions:\n- Europe Central\n- Guatemala/Belize\n- Malawi\n- Pakistan\n- Senegal\n- Solomon Islands\n- Togo\n\nUpdated maps:\n- Albania\n- Baltic\n- Bulgaria\n- North Dakota\n\nUpdated flags:\n- Albania\n- Baltic\n- Bulgaria\n- Cameroon\n- China Hong Kong\n- Ethiopia\n- Guyana\n- Jamaica\n- Marshall Islands Kiribati\n- Minnesota\n- Mississippi\n- North Dakota\n- Singapore",
